 have done something on the baht which has gained in line with regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Assistant Bank of Thailand Governor Suchada Kirakul told reporters.\par \par \uc2 (Compiled by Carl Bagh; Editing by Valerie Lee)\par \par \uc2 SOUTHEAST ASIA-HIGHLIGHTS 0900 GMT|LANGEN|Table|AFA|CSA|LBY|RWSA|RWS|REULB|GNS|G|RBN|SI|IF|PHD|RNP|DNP|PGE|SXNA   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090603e563000jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
