\par\par \b \uc2 Asia Rice-Thai prices up on firmer baht, demand thin\b0\par\par\uc2 562 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juni 2009\par 09:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Thai rice prices supported by government stockpiling\par \par \uc2 * Vietnam prices ease on increased supply\par \par \uc2 By Apornrath Phoonphongphiphat\par \par \uc2 BANGKOK, June 3 (Reuters) - Rice prices in Thailand, the world's biggest exporter, rose 6 percent on Wednesday from the previous week due mostly to a stronger baht, exporters said.\par \par \uc2 The price of Thailand's benchmark 100 percent B grade white rice <RI-THWHB-P1> rose to $578 per tonne on Wednesday, up from $545 per tonne last week.\par \par \uc2 "Demand remained thin, but prices rose because we had to compensate for the firmer \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one exporter said.\par \par \uc2 The baht rose against the dollar on Wednesday, in line with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on hopes that Asian economies will recover swiftly from the global downturn, traders said.\par \par \uc2 By 0517 GMT, the baht <THB=> was trading at 33.99 per dollar, its strongest level in eight months.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed on Wednesday it has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the rise of the baht, which has worried businesses in the export-reliant country.\par \par \uc2 Tight rice supplies were also a factor, traders said, as the government purchased rice from the country's second crop for its stockpile.\par \par \uc2 The government is paying farmers 11,800 per tonne under the current price subsidy programme which runs through July. An estimated 4 million tonnes of rice is stockpiled under various \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  schemes, traders said.\par \par \uc2 The price of domestic milled rice rose to 17,700 baht ($520.6) per tonne on Wednesday, up from last week's 15,800 per tonne, traders said.\par \par \uc2 "The government decision to put rice stocks sales on hold also supported prices," one exporter said.\par \par \uc2 Last week, Prime Minister Abhisit Vejjajiva delayed the sale of 2 million tonnes of rice from government stocks after a disagreement between two ministers over the selling prices. [ID:nBKK483309]\par \par \uc2 Thailand, the world's biggest rice exporter, has exported 3.5 million tonnes of rice so far this year, down 34 percent from 5.3 million tonnes at the same time last year, according to Commerce Ministry data.\par \par \uc2 VIETNAM PRICES EASE\par \par \uc2 Rice prices in Vietnam, the second biggest exporter, slipped this week due to rising stocks and thin demand, traders said.\par \par \uc2 Domestic paddy eased to 3,500-4,350 dong (19.7-24.5 U.S. cents) per kg in the Mekong Delta rice basket where a major crop harvest was completed, from 3,500-4,400 dong a week ago.\par \par \uc2 Prices quoted by exporters were unchanged in the past two weeks due to thin demand, with 5-percent broken rice offered at $385 a tonne, according to the Vietnam Food Association (VFA).\par \par \uc2 Traders said 25 percent broken rice was quoted unchanged at $320 a tonne.\par \par \uc2 From January to May Vietnam has exported an estimated 2.96 million tonnes of rice, up 62 percent from a year earlier, the VFA said on Monday. [ID:nHAN441183]\par \par \uc2 Vietnam's Agriculture Ministry said 40 percent of the country's five-month export volume had gone to the Philippines, the world's biggest rice importer.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam planned to export around 5 million tonnes of rice this year, up from 4.7 million tonnes in 2008. ($1=17,783 dong) ($1=34.00 Baht) (Additional reporting by Ho Binh Minh in Hanoi; Editing by Michael Urquhart)\par \par \uc2 ASIA-RICE/|LANGEN|SI|ABN|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|DNP|PCM   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090603e563000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
