\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Thai Fin Min Says Baht Stabilizing, BOT  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 2007\par 07:21\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds comments from Finance Minister.)   \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister Chalongphob Sussangkarn said Monday that the baht has been starting to soften and stabilize since last week, thanks partly to the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to limit excessive volatility.   \par \par \uc2 Earlier this month the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a new 10-year high against the U.S. dollar, triggering calls for moves to protect the export sector.   \par \par \uc2 "The direction of the baht is now more in line with the current market situation," Chalongphob told reporters.   \par \par \uc2 He reiterated the government is working on new measures to stem the baht's appreciation and boost demand for dollars.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  will propose six measures to the Cabinet on Tuesday, most of which are aimed at boosting capital outflows.   \par \par \uc2 The measures will help make it easier for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to manage the exchange rate, said Chalongphob.   \par \par \uc2 "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  manages it seriously, then it should be effective," he said.   \par \par \uc2 "If we are determined enough, the market will see it the way we want them to see it."   \par \par \uc2 Chalongphob was speaking after a meeting of the board of the inactive Exchange Equalization Fund.   \par \par \uc2 It was established in 1955 to maintain exchange-rate stability, with the baht fixed against a weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Thailand's Cabinet in January approved a plan to dissolve the fund, inactive since the floating of the baht in 1997.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the closure of the fund, Chalongphob said that there should be an entity, possibly an ad-hoc committee, that provides a forum for the finance ministry and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to discuss the management of the exchange rate.   \par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com [ 23-07-07 0521GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070723e37n000u2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
