\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Thai Ctrl Bk Asks Banks To Curb Exporters' Baht Speculation   \b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juli 2007\par 14:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2007, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of Thailand has asked commercial banks to judiciously review exporters' requests to sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in a bid to prevent speculation on the baht as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  set a fresh 10-year high Wednesday, according to a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement.   \par \par \uc2 'Recently, there is evidence that exporters have speculated on the direction of the exchange rate and accelerated their selling of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' the statement said.   \par \par \uc2 Banks must make sure exporters provide sound reasons when they fail to deliver dollars to settle their sales orders, it said.   \par \par \uc2 'This (speculation) adds to pressure on the baht and results in a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate that doesn't accurately reflect Thailand's economic situation,' the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended in onshore trade Wednesday at THB33.35, down from THB33.48 Tuesday due to equities-related inflows and selling by exporters, traders said.   \par \par \uc2 Earlier Wednesday, the U.S. unit fell to THB33.18, its lowest level since August 1997.   \par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Tarisa Watanagase said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem an 'abnormal' rise in the baht associated with panic selling by exporters. -By Rattaphol Onsanit, Dow Jones Newswires; 66 2266 0744; rattaphol.onsanit@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -0-    \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020070711e37b005h9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
