\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  still needs to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  on baht - c.bank   \b0\par\par\uc2 360 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2007\par 10:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details)   \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK, May 29 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  still needs to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop a rising baht threatening the country's key export industries, Deputy Governor Atchana Waiquamdee said on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 "We need to take care of the export sector, which is our only engine at the moment, so that it can gradually adjust," she told reporters as the baht traded at its strongest level in more than nine years.   \par \par \uc2 "But \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cannot be overdone because it will affect our balance sheet," she said.   \par \par \uc2 At 0900 GMT the baht traded at 34.59 per the dollar onshore <THB=TH>, little changed from Monday. It was at 32.85 in offshore trade <THB=W>.   \par \par \uc2 The baht has evolved into a two-tier on and offshore market since the imposition of tough capital controls in December which require 30 percent of foreign inflows to be held at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , interest free, for a year.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  sporadically in a vain effort so far to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise.   \par \par \uc2 The baht has risen 4.3 percent against the dollar so far this year after a 14 percent rise last year.   \par \par \uc2 Atchana said an improving political picture would help to boost imports and ease upward pressure on the baht.   \par \par \uc2 A court decide will decide on Wednesday whether to disband Thailand's biggest two parties and ban their leaders from politics for breaching election laws a year ago.   \par \par \uc2 The decision could plunge the country into more political uncertainty ahead of promised elections in December.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has cut interest rates four times this year to 3.5 percent in an effort to revive an economy expected to grow at its slowest pace this year since 2001.   \par \par \uc2 The bank has cut its 2007 economic growth forecast twice this year to a range of 3.8-4.8 percent, after 5 percent growth last year, due to sagging domestic consumption and investment since Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra was ousted in a bloodless military coup last September.   \par \par \uc2 THAILAND-ECONOMY/BAHT (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070529e35t000ih\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
