\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk Deputy Chief: Still Need To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt   \b0\par\par\uc2 131 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2007\par 12:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Atchana Waiquamdee said Tuesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  still needs to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 "There is a need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to take care of the baht to ensure that the baht moves appropriately," Atchana told a seminar on financial globalization.   \par \par \uc2 She said exporters will suffer if the baht exchange rate is excessively volatile.   \par \par \uc2 Traders said her comments didn't have any impact on the baht.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended flat Tuesday at THB34.60, after moving in a tight THB34.60-THB34.61 range throughout the session amid moderate trade.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     -By Bangkok bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 66 2266 0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 29-05-07 1028GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070529e35t000k8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
