\par\par \b \uc2 Thai Ctrl Bk: Baht Still Rising Too Fast  \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2006\par 07:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of Thailand Assistant Governor Suchada Kirakul said Tuesday that the baht is still rising too fast and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to "take care" of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but she declined to comment on any specific forms of current or planned \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 At 0633 GMT, the dollar bounced back to THB35.32 after Suchada's comments from a nine-year low of THB35.25 that it hit earlier in the day. [ 12-12-06 0636GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 "The baht has been rising too fast and it is still rising too fast," Suchada said.  \par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said it appeared that agents of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be entering the market to buy dollars and restrain the baht's rise, after sitting on their hands for the first half of the Asian day.  \par \par \uc2 But the assistant governor wouldn't comment on whether the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 "We have been taking care of the baht and we are still taking care of it," she said.  \par \par \uc2 But she said there are many ways to care for the baht under the managed float system, including regulatory measures designed to reduce speculative activity.  \par \par \uc2 Suchada also declined to comment, however, on whether the Bank of Thailand was planning any further measures to tighten curbs on short-term capital inflows.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still evaluating the effectiveness of measures introduced last week, she said.  \par \par \uc2 The latest moves by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  banned short-term trading of local bonds by nonresidents, and expanded restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps and loans between onshore and offshore financial institutions.  \par \par \uc2 -By Phisanu Phromchanya, Dow Jones Newswires; 66 2266 0744; phisanu.phromchanya@dowjones.com [ 12-12-06 0701GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061212e2cc00065\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
