\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Strong baht may prompt easing of capital controls  \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 2006\par 04:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  (Adds quotes, detail)  \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Nov 23 (Reuters) - Thailand may relax its capital controls further to help ease upward pressure on the rising baht, Bank of Thailand Governor (BOT) Tarisa Watanagase said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's efforts to slow the appreciation of the baht through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  were limited, she told a seminar.  \par \par \uc2  The Thai private sector should manage and hedge \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks, she said, with the baht having risen about 12.5 percent against the dollar so far this year, the fastest riser of any Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2  "The BOT can move to prevent the baht's excessive volatility, but its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can be done only to an extent, especially as the dollar sustains its weakness," Tarisa said.  \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might consider easing capital controls further in the future to relieve pressure on the baht, she said without elaboration.  \par \par \uc2  Thailand has given private institutional investors more room to invest abroad in the past year.  \par \par \uc2  But the baht remained competitive and its hefty rise this year had not hurt Thai exports seriously, Tarisa said.  \par \par \uc2  Thai export groups called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week to take more action to help them cope with the steadily rising baht.  \par \par \uc2  October Thai exports rose 20.1 percent from the same month of 2005, a robust pace sustained since the second half of this year despite the baht strength.      \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-\b \highlight22\uc2 THAILAND\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061123e2bn0006e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
